,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[1,0,1,1.12]},"move":{"r1":0.111,"r5":0.0249,"r1_spy":0.1228,"r5_spy":0.0259}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2018-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"…to their cable bill, and we announced a partnership with DAZN, a fast-growing sports subscription streaming service in Japan. We remain very confident in the growth ahead of Spotify, and you can expect to continue to see us manage for growth over profitability as we strive to create an ecosystem…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2018-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Michael Morris","x":"Will Spotify be in some way prioritized as a streaming service for users relative to Google's YouTube Music?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2018-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"What we continue to do is we continue to look at ways where we can streamline the user experience and make it more easy to use and more beneficial to users, and this is one of those changes that we had shipped prior with very good results to our free users, and we're now consolidating the code…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2019-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"W. Barry McCarthy","x":"And remember, when we launched streaming Netflix first year, we spent $50 million (ph) and then every year after that we doubled it, and it came right out of the margin structure of the business, but it greatly enhanced the value proposition for users, and over time, it shifted the cost structure…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2019-02-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"W. Barry McCarthy","x":"…cost base, plus over time, you're shifting your cost base from variable to fixed, which created an enormous amount of operating leverage at Netflix, you may recall with the growth in streaming. And that won't be true for us initially, but I think that will become part of the equation over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2018 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"W. Barry McCarthy","x":"So we continue to invest aggressively from an R&D perspective in growing that channel, we need that channel to be successful for us over time in order to right size our cost structure but we're starting off with a very small base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2019-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"Looking more broadly at our global music economy, it was really encouraging to see that 2018 industry data has shown strong growth across the music industry, led almost entirely by streaming, which accounted for 47% of all recorded music revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/spotify-spot-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2019-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"With physical and download revenue in decline, the 34% year-over-year growth in streaming is the engine driving the train, and Spotify continues to be the driving force that has made the music a growth industry again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/spotify-spot-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2019-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"At our investor day in April of last year, we said that we're still in the early innings of the growth of the streaming audio market, and we still believe that true's today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/spotify-technology-spot-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2019-07-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"I think overall, we're still, to level set, in the growth phase of the business and very early on, as I mentioned in my opening remarks, of the streaming audio market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/spotify-technology-spot-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2019-10-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry McCarthy","x":"I would say, aside from that, we do see some scale economies in the business in the other content cost -- other cost of revenue line associated with reduction in streaming costs, reduction in customer service as a percent of revenue and reduction in payment fees as a percent of revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/spotify-technology-spot-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2019-10-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Barry McCarthy","x":"So streaming was to Netflix as podcasting is to Spotify.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/spotify-technology-spot-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"Regarding the price increase test for Family Plan in Scandinavia, can you update on what the response has been for your members so far in terms of both gross adds and churn?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/spotify-technology-spot-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2020-02-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"On the podcasting side, we announced the addition of streaming audio insertion, which is a tool which we think will help us monetize podcasts going forward as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/spotify-technology-spot-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2019 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2020-02-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"And by some estimates now, we should be the largest U.S. audio streaming service as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/05/spotify-technology-spot-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2020-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"And while most focus is on competition between streaming services, we continue to be focused on the billions of users that are listening to linear radio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/spotify-technology-spot-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2020-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"Time at home has moved people out of their cars, requiring them to shift their listening behaviors, and that's when they discover streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/spotify-technology-spot-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"That suggests a lower outlook for advertising is a minority.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/spotify-technology-spot-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"We expect that we might get some questions based on the current environment, so we have reiterated the guidance we started with at the beginning of the year for marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/spotify-technology-spot-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2021-02-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"For Spotify, more time at home resulted in more people discovering streaming and turning to our platform, but it also created disruption in listening habits, consumption hours and the release of new music and podcasts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2021-02-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"And I expect that as the category of audio ads matures and more radio dollars move to streaming, this area will become much more predictable, but for the next year or two, it will be a bit more uncertain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2021-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"For example, while we have seen some pull forward effects that may slow down subscriber growth in some markets, we are shifting to drive more aggressive revenue growth where we know our pricing power will enable us to increase ARPU.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2020 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2021-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"We've long believed that Spotify provides exceptional value, and the positive early data we're seeing from this price increase that we announced in October makes us very optimistic that our users agree.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2021-04-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"Our strategy to move from being a streaming service to being an audio platform is really starting to come to life.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2021-04-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"It's seen an increase of 54% in global recorded music revenues since the 2014 low and streaming revenues with a growth rate of more than 600% over the same time period, continue to propel the industry forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"Related to this, look no further than the price increases we just announced across 12 key markets, including the U.K. and U.S. And we did this on the back of successful rollouts in the previous two quarters when we implemented price increases in more than 30 markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2021-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"What percentage of your users have seen price increases thus far?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2021-07-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"So payment fees, streaming delivery, customer service, those types of things, where we got a little bit better leverage than we thought.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2021-07-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Related to podcasting, how would you characterize the early returns on the Spotify Audience Network, the Open Access platform, and Streaming Ad Insertion?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"And again, what gives you confidence that slower MAU growth is a function of COVID as opposed to a function of price increases, competition and/or saturation?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"In terms of the first half of the second part of that question, again, talking about COVID, I think I mentioned in the last question, I will say, we obviously don't think it's price increases because our subscriber growth was actually slightly better-than-expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Can you provide color on Churn trends in the market that saw price increase recently?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2021 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Vogel","x":"Yes, we were -- we've been really pleased with the markets where we've seen price increases both from a gross intake perspective and a churn perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/spotify-technology-sa-spot-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2025-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Daniel G. Ek","x":"And this value not only benefits users, but it's attracting more people to streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/ea