fy-spot-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2025-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Ek","x":"We also saw steady retention rates following the rollout of our recent price increases across more than 150 markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/spotify-spot-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q3","e":"spot","d":"2025-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Luiga","x":"Our subscriber outlook implies net additions of 8 million, which is slightly below prior year net adds due to the expected small amount of churn we see when we raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/23/spotify-spot-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"streaming","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"We drove the shift from downloads to streaming and subscription, and we proved the model could work at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"streaming","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"We acquired Echo Nest back in 2014 when most people didn't understand why a streaming company needed a machine learning AI company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"If you could expand a bit more on Spotify's role in AI music, do you need to invest in content creation tools?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"And thus, you have a domino sequence of how really we enhance the value of our platform as we continue to invest in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Luiga","x":"And as Alex mentioned, the churn with respect to these price increases is in line with our expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Luiga","x":"But looking at the gross margin pace here in quarter 4 going into quarter 1 and also for next year and the things that drives that, I mean, what I said was that the price increases that we have done here is going to outpace the net content cost in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2025 Q4","e":"spot","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"You can't just have an LLM commoditize it as a fact, the way you can commoditize Wikipedia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/spotify-spot-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"streaming","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Now on top of the streaming success, there's no doubt that artists, songwriters, musicians and fans are just always seeking stronger connections.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Q1 had higher marketing cloud and AI spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"We're seeing many companies wrestle with headcount investment versus rising AI costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian Luiga","x":"We saw no surprises with respect to price increase related churn following our January U.S. price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Have you seen anything unusual in subscriber reaction to your recent price increase?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"You could translate it straight into cost savings and cut headcount, which some companies out there are doing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Investor concerns over AI disruption have increased.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q1","e":"spot","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x":"Could you outline the key moats for Spotify that limit the risk from, one, stand-alone low-cost, free AI music alternatives; two, large platform peers that offer free AI music services; and three, competition from AI-first alternatives, which integrate label content?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/spotify-spot-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SPOT 2026 Q2","e":"spot","d":"2026-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan Goldberg","x